  "notes": "Scholarly monograph published in 2012 as Journal of Cuneiform Studies Supplemental Series 3 by the American Schools of Oriental Research. It develops a causal and distribution-sensitive method for evaluating variation in copies of Sumerian literary compositions. Delnero’s separate 2024 chapter Errors or Innovation? supplies a later control: textual stability, erasure, accepted variance, and creative change differ by corpus and transmission practice. Current coverage is bibliographic, with source-reported authorship awaiting review.",
